2.2. Data collection {#s0025}
---------------------

The survey was administered using an online survey application which was created with surveyMonkey (www.surveymonkey.com). This program allows respondents to give their name, email address and other required information. Participants were instructed to answer questions related to their age, gender, education, country, and employment status. Participants who completed the survey with a valid email address were sent a link to complete the survey anonymously.

